# The compiled agent runtime (Bot + GenAiPlannerBundle) is a BUILD OUTPUT of the
# `agent publish authoring-bundle` command — the .agent authoring bundle is the source
# of truth. Ignoring these keeps the publish command (which uses source-tracking) from
# pulling the compiled graph back into source, which would re-introduce the T11
# Bot / AiAuthoringBundle DeveloperName collision on a clean deploy.
# Reference copy of the compiled graph: reference/compiled-agent-runtime/.
**/bots/**
**/genAiPlannerBundles/**
